[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0109","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-20001","title":"Diffie-Hellman 密钥协商协议 D(HE)ater 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Diffie-Hellman 密钥交换协议存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者（客户端）可向服务器发送非公钥的任意数值，触发服务器端昂贵的 DHE 模幂运算，导致服务器 CPU 资源被大量消耗，造成拒绝服务。攻击者仅需极少的客户端计算资源和网络带宽即可发起攻击，且可要求服务器使用其支持的最大密钥长度以放大攻击效果。该漏洞影响所有支持 DHE 密码套件的 TLS 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-20001"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2021-11-11T19:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:27Z","remediation":"建议在服务器端禁用 DHE 密码套件，仅启用 ECDHE 密钥交换；若必须支持 DHE，将 Diffie-Hellman 参数长度限制为 1024 位以下，并配置每连接 DH 计算超时（如 5 秒）；在 nginx 中设置 ssl_ciphers 'EECDH+AESGCM:EDH+AESGCM' 并移除 DHE 套件；Apache 中配置 SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters 并使用小参数文件；同时部署 TLS 1.3（仅支持 ECDHE），彻底消除 DHE 协商路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-506569.pdf","https://dheatattack.com","https://dheatattack.gitlab.io/","https://github.com/Balasys/dheater","https://github.com/mozilla/ssl-config-generator/issues/162","https://gitlab.com/dheatattack/dheater","https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10374117","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K83120834","https://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2022-004.txt","https://www.openssl.org/blog/blog/2022/10/21/tls-groups-configuration/","https://www.reddit.com/r/netsec/comments/qdoosy/server_overload_by_enforcing_dhe_key_exchange/","https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Anton-Stiglic-2/publication/2401745_Security_Issues_in_the_Diffie-Hellman_Key_Agreement_Protocol","https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020510","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-20001.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2002/CVE-2002-20001.json","https://github.com/OWASP/CheatSheetSeries/blob/92de0115bab1b671bf66cdfb7afca90f0974fa39/cheatsheets/Transport_Layer_Security_Cheat_Sheet.md","https://github.com/jtesta/ssh-audit/blob/111399e4319a7297c9edd075725048c5638dbceb/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/927a9d84fb186283fa3c636924460ca0aefac60e/2002/CVE-2002-20001.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2002-20001","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2021/gb_ssh_CVE-2002-20001_CVE-2022-40735.nasl","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/f2163b4f7618847ae6f61df336623d37548fdbfc/unittests/scans/cycognito/one_vuln.json","https://github.com/c0r0n3r/dheater/blob/1b638ded0755f5d1b12f5f4ebfbde1ad8fa505cd/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2021/gb_ssl_tls_CVE-2002-20001.nasl","https://github.com/c0r0n3r/dheater","https://github.com/itmaniac/dheat_dos_attack_poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0438","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0438.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2438","title":"Linux Linux Kernel TCP/IP 认证绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TCP 协议栈在处理防火墙规则时存在安全绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送设置了 RST 等其他标志位的特制 SYN 数据包，由于 Linux TCP 协议栈在防火墙过滤后未能正确丢弃此类异常数据包，导致防火墙规则被绕过。该漏洞允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者绕过网络访问控制策略，对目标系统造成潜在的未授权访问风险。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2438"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2021-05-18T12:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:18Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.20 或更高版本，该版本在 tcp_input.c 中增加了对 SYN+RST 等非法 TCP 标志组合包的丢弃检查。如无法升级内核，可在防火墙层面配置规则丢弃 SYN+RST、SYN+FIN 等异常标志组合的数据包，并启用状态检测（stateful inspection）防火墙以跟踪连接状态而非仅依赖 TCP 标志位。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/02/03/7","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/29/8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/11","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/12","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/13","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/8","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/30/9","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/31/3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/02/12/8","https://bugzilla.suse.com/show_bug.cgi?id=744994%2C","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20210727-0003/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/464113","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/464113%2C","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/02/03/7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2438.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2438","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2438.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-2438","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2002-2438-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-2438","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-2438","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2438.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2438.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2002/CVE-2002-2438.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0438.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0441","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0441.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2439","title":"GNU GCC 整数溢出漏洞","description":"GCC（GNU Compiler Collection）4.8.0 之前版本中的 `new[]` 运算符存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当处理大型数组分配时，`new[]` 运算符在计算所需内存大小时未正确检查整数溢出，导致分配的内存空间小于预期，进而引发堆缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者可通过编译并运行特制的 C++ 程序触发该漏洞，造成程序崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有 GCC 4.8.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2439"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2019-10-23T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:18Z","remediation":"升级 GCC 至 4.8.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 new[] 运算符中的整数溢出漏洞。对于无法立即升级编译器的系统，可考虑使用其他已修复的编译器版本（如 Clang）进行代码编译作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/cve-2002-2439","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=CVE-2002-2439","https://gcc.gnu.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=19351","https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2002-2439","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2439","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-24xx/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/justakazh/CVE_Database/blob/06bd07f32c89b43f30d59ff450dfbb661e471cbe/2002/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2002/CVE-2002-2439.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2439.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2002/CVE-2002-2439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0441.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0443","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0443.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2443","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 kpasswd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 5（krb5）1.11.3 之前版本中 kadmind 服务的 kpasswd 组件（schpw.c）存在输入验证漏洞。远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制的伪造 UDP 数据包，由于服务在发送响应前未正确验证数据包合法性，触发服务端之间的通信循环，导致目标系统 CPU 和带宽资源被大量消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有运行 MIT Kerberos 5 1.11.3 之前版本的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2443"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2013-05-29T14:29:06Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:18Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 (krb5) 至 1.11.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 kpasswd 服务中 UDP 数据包校验缺失导致的 ping-pong 拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或网络层面限制对 kpasswd 服务 UDP 端口（默认 464）的访问，仅允许可信来源连接，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://krbdev.mit.edu/rt/Ticket/Display.html?id=7637","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-May/105879.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-May/105978.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-May/106698.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2013-07/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2013-07/msg00007.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0942.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2013/dsa-2701","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:166","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2810-1","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=962531","https://github.com/krb5/krb5/commit/cf1a0c411b2668c57c41e9c4efd15ba17b6b322c","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-2443.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2443.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-2443.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2443","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2002/UBUNTU-CVE-2002-2443.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/vex/cve/2002/CVE-2002-2443.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-2443","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/003e8cad66924d61c3369093ab10818154ac5271/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-2443.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-2443.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-2443"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0443.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0104","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1580","title":"Cyrus IMAP 服务器预登录堆损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cyrus IMAP 服务器 1.4 至 2.1.10 版本的 imapparse.c 文件中存在整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的包含超长长度值的 IMAP 协议数据包，触发整数溢出进而导致堆缓冲区溢出，最终可在 Cyrus IMAPD 进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Cyrus IMAPD 1.4、1.5.19、2.0.12、2.0.16、2.1.9 及 2.1.10 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可在未登录前（Pre-Login）即触发该漏洞，利用门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1580"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2004-06-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:35Z","remediation":"升级 Cyrus IMAP 服务器至 2.1.11 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2.1.11 中修复），或升级至 2.2.x 系列。对于无法升级的旧系统，可在 imapd.conf 中设置 `loginrawdisabled: 1` 禁用未认证阶段的 raw 命令处理，并在网络层面限制对 IMAP 端口（143/tcp、993/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://asg.web.cmu.edu/cyrus/download/imapd/changes.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000557","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-215","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/740169","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/301864","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6298","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10744","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1580.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1580","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1580.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1580.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5xcv-v8fh-pcrc/GHSA-5xcv-v8fh-pcrc.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/a70c5c3fd44b49eb692a4703fe91a62b37c58ce7/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/freebsd_cyrus_2017.nasl","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1580","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0097.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cyrus_imap_prelogin_overflow.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0408","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1574","title":"Linux ixj 电话卡驱动缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.20 之前版本中的 ixj 电话卡驱动程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过向驱动程序发送特制的请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统部分机密性、完整性和可用性受损。攻击需要本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度较低，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1574"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2004-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.20 或更高版本以修复 ixj 电话卡驱动中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2004-044 或 RHSA-2004-106 提供的更新内核包。如无法立即升级，可通过 `rmmod ixj` 卸载 ixj 驱动模块，或在 `/etc/modprobe.d/` 中添加 `blacklist ixj` 禁止自动加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-096.shtml","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-205.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-206.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-044.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-106.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5985","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10417","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1574","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2002/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1574.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1574.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1574.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0103","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1569","title":"GNU gv 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"gv 3.5.8 及更早版本在处理 PDF 文件或 gzip 压缩文件的文件名时，未对 shell 元字符（如反引号、$()、| 等）进行有效过滤，存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 shell 元字符的特制文件名，诱使用户在 gv 中打开该文件，从而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1569"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34Z","remediation":"升级 gv 至 3.5.8-27 及以上版本（Debian 对应版本 1:3.5.8-27），或直接升级至 3.7.4 及以上版本。该漏洞源于 gv 在处理 PDF 和 gzip 文件名时未过滤 shell 元字符，攻击者可构造恶意文件名触发任意命令执行。如无法升级，避免使用 gv 打开来源不明的 PDF/gzip 文件，或改用其他 PDF 阅读器（如 evince、okular）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-10/0033.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103348446009076&w=2","http://www.epita.fr/~bevand_m/asa/asa-0000","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5840","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10231","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-1569.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1569","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1569.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1569.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5c66-864x-76jc/GHSA-5c66-864x-76jc.json","https://github.com/0xCyberY/CVE-T4PDF/blob/91e0c8080e34fbea79154cd21d1239bd51201f30/README.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_147600_147700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2ac33f9d-24dc-4a35-8534-c62040065949.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edb64b2fb998e69a1765a394aaca0eefbc537f56/2002/CVE-2002-1569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0102","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1568","title":"OpenSSL OpenSSL 0.9.6e 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6e 版本在检测缓冲区溢出攻击时使用了断言（assertion）机制而非更温和的错误处理方式，导致远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 SSLv2 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息触发断言失败，从而使 OpenSSL 进程异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞位于 s2_srvr.c 文件中，对 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息的处理未进行充分校验。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程触发，影响运行 OpenSSL 0.9.6e 的服务端程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1568"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34Z","remediation":"升级至 OpenSSL 0.9.7 或更高版本，该版本已将 s2_srvr.c 中的断言式错误处理替换为安全的错误恢复机制，避免因 SSLv2 CLIENT_MASTER_KEY 消息触发断言失败导致服务崩溃。如无法立即升级，可在服务端配置中禁用 SSLv2 协议作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cvs.openssl.org/chngview?cn=7659","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=106511018214983","http://www.ebitech.sk/