c.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=103158692532256&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5680","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10081","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21784","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1566","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1566.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1566","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8f4h-52c3-crrw/GHSA-8f4h-52c3-crrw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1566.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7aea8f1-1f42-4f5b-8f8e-792dfde8c214.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x6000/5680/info.html","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7aea8f1-1f42-4f5b-8f8e-792dfde8c214.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0302","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1155","title":"KON kon2 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"KON kon2 0.3.9b及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向 kon2 程序传递超长的 -Coding 命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统上使用 kon2 控制台工具的环境，攻击者需要本地系统访问权限，成功利用后可获取与目标进程相同的权限，实现本地权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1155"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:49Z","remediation":"建议升级 kon2 至 0.3.9b 以上版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:047/RHSA-2003:050 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:064 补丁。如无法升级，移除 kon2 的 setuid 位以缓解提权风险：chmod u-s /usr/bin/kon。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105474080512376&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105577912106710&w=2","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:064","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-047.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-050.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22720","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1155.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1155.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1155.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1155.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1155","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1155.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1155.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1155.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1155.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1155.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0100","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1565","title":"GNU wget url_filename 函数缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Wget 1.8.1 的 url_filename 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 URL 的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致 wget 进程发生段错误（segmentation fault），造成拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Wget 1.8.1 及更早版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1565"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 wget 至 1.8.2 及以上版本。Debian 用户执行 apt-get update && apt-get install wget 更新至 1.8.2-3；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:372 提供的更新包；SCO OpenLinux 用户应用 CSSA-2003-003.0 补丁。如无法升级，可在网络边界或应用层限制 URL 长度，避免传递超长 URL 触发缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000716","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105474357016184&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-209","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-372.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10851","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1565","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1565.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1565.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1565.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0597","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1457","title":"Leszek Krupinski L-Forum 2.4 search.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"L-Forum 是由 Leszek Krupinski 开发的基于 PHP 的论坛程序，2.4.0 及更早版本的 search.php 文件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该文件在处理用户搜索请求时，未对 search 参数进行充分的输入验证与过滤，直接将用户输入拼入 SQL 查询语句，导致远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 SQL 代码的搜索参数，在数据库服务器上执行任意 SQL 语句。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 L-Forum 的网站，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件为攻击者能够访问目标网站的 search.php 页面。利用方式为向 search.php 的 search 参数提交包含 SQL 注入 payload 的特制 URL，PostgreSQL 和 MySQL 数据库的利用语法略有不同。成功利用后攻击者可获取论坛数据库中的敏感信息，包括用户账号、密码哈希等，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1457"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:21Z","remediation":"修改 search.php 中对 search 参数的数据库查询方式，使用参数化预处理语句替代字符串拼接，并对用户输入进行类型校验与特殊字符过滤；如无法即时修改代码，可临时在 Web 服务器前端对该参数进行 WAF 拦截或限制仅允许字母数字与空格，阻止单引号与分号等 SQL 关键字传入后端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0074.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9837.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5468","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21708","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1457","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2002/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1457.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1457.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1457.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0597.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0596","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1456","title":"mIRC mIRC 6.0 脚本引擎 ASCTime 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"mIRC 6.0.2 及更早版本在脚本引擎处理 $asctime 变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过发送包含超长 $asctime 值的特制 IRC 消息或恶意脚本文件，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击者可远程利用，影响所有使用受影响版本 mIRC 的用户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1456"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:21Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 mIRC 6.03 或更高版本，该版本已修复 $asctime 标识符的缓冲区溢出漏洞。升级操作：访问 mIRC 官方网站（mirc.com）下载最新安装包，关闭正在运行的 mIRC 进程，运行安装程序完成覆盖安装。如暂时无法升级，可采取以下缓解措施：禁用脚本编辑器中的自动脚本执行功能，不加载来源不明的脚本文件，在防火墙中限制 IRC 端口的入站连接，避免在公共 IRC 频道中接收或执行未知脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q3/0092.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103046375002380&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=103046138631893&w=2","http://www.mirc.co.uk/whatsnew.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5576","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9970","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21759","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1456.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1456.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1456.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1456.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1456","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1456.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1456.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1456.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1456.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1456.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0595","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0595.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1455","title":"Omnicron OmniHTTPd 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"OmniHTTPd Web 服务器存在多个跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的 URL，诱骗用户访问受影响页面的方式，将脚本或 HTML 代码注入 Web 页面。该漏洞影响 OmniHTTPd 1.1、2.0.x 及 2.4 版本的示例应用文件，包括 test.php、test.shtml 和 redir.exe，攻击条件要求受害者在已登录会话的情况下点击恶意链接。成功利用后，攻击者可窃取用户 Cookie、会话令牌或页面内容，进而冒充用户身份执行未授权操作，影响数据保密性与完整性。建议移除或禁用服务器中的示例应用程序文件，并升级至 OmniHTTPd 官方已修复该漏洞的安全版本，同时对所有用户输入进行严格过滤和输出编码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1455"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:21Z","remediation":"删除 OmniHTTPd 安装目录下 test.php、test.shtml 和 redir.exe 等示例文件，或通过服务器配置禁用对示例应用程序的访问。由于 OmniHTTPd 已停止维护且厂商未发布修复补丁，建议迁移到 Apache 或 Nginx 等持续更新的 Web 服务器作为永久解决方案。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙或反向代理层面拦截对 /test.shtml、/test.php、/redir.exe 等示例路径的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0263.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0264.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-08/0266.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21754","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1455.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1455","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1455.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2002/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1455.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1455.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0595.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0099","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1563","title":"stunnel SIGCHLD信号处理程序竞争条件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"stunnel 4.0.3 及更早版本存在信号处理器竞争条件漏洞。程序在处理 SIGCHLD 信号时，信号处理器与主程序并发访问子进程计数器，存在竞态条件，可导致计数器状态不一致，进而使 stunnel 进程崩溃。攻击者无需较高权限，只需使大量子进程在特定时机快速退出以触发竞态窗口，即可导致服务进程异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 stunnel 4.0.3 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 1.2，危害等级较低，建议升级至 4.0.4 或更高版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1563"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-05-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:33Z","remediation":"建议立即将 stunnel 升级到 4.0.4 或更高版本（该版本修复了 SIGCHLD 信号处理器的竞态条件，避免子进程计数器不一致导致崩溃）。若使用较新的红帽系发行版，请安装 RHSA-2003-221 与 RHSA-2003-223 提供的更新包。在无法立即升级的情况下，可通过限制本地可登录用户、仅对可信主机开放 stunnel 监听的 TLS 端口，并监控进程异常退出日志作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000736","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104247606910598","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=106029168514511&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=stunnel-users&m=103600188215117&w=2","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-3535.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-221.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-223.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6592","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1563.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1563","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1563.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f